IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-AWQ-V2-QUANT.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DIM-D               PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 BITS-B              PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 PROTECTED-WEIGHTS   PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 COMPRESSION-RATIO   PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-AWQ-V2.
    IF DIM-D == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF BITS-B == 0
        MOVE 4 TO BITS-B.
    END-IF.

    MOVE DIM-D TO PROTECTED-WEIGHTS.
    DIVIDE 10 INTO PROTECTED-WEIGHTS.

    MOVE 32 TO COMPRESSION-RATIO.
    DIVIDE BITS-B INTO COMPRESSION-RATIO.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 PROTECTED-WEIGHTS.
    WEIGHT 30 COMPRESSION-RATIO.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
